OL,3,GNEWSABusy motorway reopens following
OL,4,Apower fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy motorway has reopened after an
OL,7,Felectrical fault required urgent
OL,8,Frepairs.
OL,10,FThe M5 was shut in both directions
OL,11,Fearlier between Junction 22 at
OL,12,FBurnham-on-Sea and Junction 23 at
OL,13,FBridgwater to allow National Grid to
OL,14,Fdeal with the issue on an overhead
OL,15,Fline.
OL,17,FThe nearby A38 had been allocated as
OL,18,Fthe main diversion route.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
