OL,3,GNEWSABusy motorway reopens following
OL,4,Apower fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M5 was also closed in June in the
OL,7,Fsame area due to the risk of overhead
OL,8,Felectricity cables falling onto the
OL,9,Froad, though a National Grid
OL,10,Fspokesperson confirmed Friday's fault
OL,11,Fwas in a different location to the
OL,12,Fprevious incident.
